{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act49side_level_act49side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act49side",
  "stageId": "act49side_03",
  "title": "聚墨痕",
  "storyCode": "TA-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act49side/level_act49side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ad009a4ec6f3e3859deadca7def227bfa077d18a3157048aa6f1cdfa2fec789d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "陈小姐，请将手中之物交还——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放开人质！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先把木锁还来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈昭芊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "各位......我们要不先冷静下来，好好谈谈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "远远就听见了楼下的声响，还以为是某处的伥怪复又暴动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不料是三位客人，在此切磋武艺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梁大人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "左公子，别来无恙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（左公子......似乎在罗德岛上听到过。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阁中祸乱难靖，梁某正忧心该如何解决......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "见到司岁台派左公子前来协理，总算是能安心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......莫非梁某误会了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "监正大人自有安排，不劳梁大人费心。既然我此刻在此，自当尽力协助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那公子缉拿这位面生的小姐，也是监正大人的授意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她叫莫佚......是山海众的一员。数日之前在邙山镇中惹生事端，如今又在伥怪横行之时现身百灶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行迹可疑，在下必须彻查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "左秉烛还真是不领情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "山海众......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（挟紧陈昭芊，警惕地后退）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "城中戒严，山海众如果在这里只是为了惹生事端......莫小姐，反倒称得上一句“勇气可嘉”了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈，你看上去比这位秉烛人还要木讷一点，没想到还算明事理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那能不能麻烦你和这位左公子说说，让他先不要一门心思和我过不去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梁某人微言轻，只能恳请莫小姐放开这位......在下的同僚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“遍览山川湖泽，穷究自然物理”，这是千年前山海众最初的信条。至于伤及无辜，应当也不是莫小姐的本意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梁大人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎么会知道这些事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "片刻沉默之后，莫佚还刃入鞘，又将身前的典水官轻轻向前推了推。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你没事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈昭芊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无碍......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈昭芊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "新来的誊录郎，多谢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果在下没认错这柄剑的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "陈小姐在此时回到百灶，的确是出人意料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "玉门参知，梁洵，梁大人。前番在玉门，我在魏彦吾身旁见过你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大人身居要职，“人微言轻”四字，未免过谦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梁某如今只是这天镜阁中一名再普通不过的誊录郎。陈小姐远道而来，尚不知晓梁某去职之事，亦属常情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（目光锁定左乐手中的木锁）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还敢妄动！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啧，那个信物暂且不论，这木锁本就是我的东西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那又如何。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "交代清楚你的来意，我会视情况处置这枚木锁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......说了你也不信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老天师究竟为何会放你来百灶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她老人家发了话，战事在即，城中混乱，难免有人争功逞能，趁机生事......“那个秉烛人小孩此趟回城，怕是会遇上不少阻碍。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她既带走了麟少卿和云先生，于情于理，都该帮左秉烛再寻个帮手——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“若是看到有人阻挠那小子执行公务，你便尽可能从旁关照关照。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不然，你以为我会愿意，来帮你这个榆木脑袋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......那这木锁是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还要隐瞒？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......是娘亲留下的遗物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈昭芊&陈&梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（怔住）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现下我人也放了，娘亲的遗物也在你手里，你到底还想怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这......即便有前辈的交代，你还是须随我走一趟司岁台，将先前诸事交代明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要你别再惹是生非，等事情结束，我保证这木锁完好无损地回到你手里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你无非是想把木锁留在自己手里挟制我，是也不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我都说了，现在的司岁台——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "诸位，既然误会已经解开，那能否暂时罢手，先将当下局面厘清？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=2>望日前两日 午时</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梁大人，你一直在天镜阁，那你是否清楚，这些凭空出现的甲士，到底是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "关于此事，还是让左公子来解释吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它们是“伥物”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "据司岁台研究，部分巨兽拥有使死物化形的权能。图画，器具，文字......都在此列。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如今出现在百灶城中的伥物，或许是借由天镜阁中史书所记载的，大狩猎时期的炎国军队形象现身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "此刻出现，应是与岁陵中的异动有关。至于它们为何时隐时现，我也不知——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是巨兽的呼吸吐纳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“生物之以息相吹”，如今这些伥物出现的频率越来越高，那恰恰说明——祂的梦快要醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你为何会知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都说了，要论起巨兽研究，你们才是后来者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那这字伥的源头，为何会是天镜阁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梁洵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在下于巨兽之学所知并不算精通，关于天镜阁，在下只是有一个猜想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梁大人！......慎言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫佚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "够了，都已经是什么时候了，你还要死守着你那一套规矩？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我没有打算刺探司岁台秘辛，但眼下事态紧急，我们有必要共享情报。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左乐",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
